Package: tm.hyslaw
Title: Teal Modules for Hy's Law Monitoring and eDISH Plots
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person(
    "Y.G.", "Ma",
    email = "ygma@users.noreply.github.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre")
  )
Description: Provides an open-source teal module and reusable builders for
    exploratory Hy's Law monitoring from CDISC ADaM-style ADSL and ADLB.
    Peak eDISH, mDISH, and cholestatic screening plots plus concurrent
    ALT/AST plus bilirubin elevations (optional ALP exclusion) are classified
    without depending on study-specific ADDILI datasets. Table and plot
    builders can be called without launching Shiny.
